From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: v-zhangxiaomeng5 <v-zhangxiaomeng5@xiaomi.com>
Date: Wed, 8 Apr 2026 14:58:59 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] libcxx: fix C++20 features in source files for C++17
 compatibility

Upstream always builds the library with C++23, but NuttX needs to support C++17, 4 files are updated:
- src/algorithm.cpp: replace ranges::less (C++20) with __less<> for C++17, guarded by _LIBCPP_STD_VER
- src/include/from_chars_floating_point.h: replace floating_point concept (C++20) with class template parameter for C++17, guarded by _LIBCPP_STD_VER
- src/include/to_chars_floating_point.h: replace std::bit_cast (C++20) with __bit_cast (internal, all standards), add __bit/bit_cast.h include
- src/iostream.cpp: guard constexpr destructor (C++20) and replace std::construct_at (C++20) with placement new for C++17

The CMake layer also adds -D"constinit=..." for C++17 and excludes barrier.cpp/atomic.cpp (C++20-only files).

Signed-off-by: v-zhangxiaomeng5 <v-zhangxiaomeng5@xiaomi.com>
---
 src/algorithm.cpp                       |  7 +++++++
 src/include/from_chars_floating_point.h | 20 ++++++++++++++++++++
 src/include/to_chars_floating_point.h   | 11 ++++++-----
 src/iostream.cpp                        | 10 +++++++++-
 4 files changed, 42 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/algorithm.cpp b/src/algorithm.cpp
index 8157be6f74..16807b94c1 100644
--- a/src/algorithm.cpp
+++ b/src/algorithm.cpp
@@ -21,10 +21,17 @@ void __sort(RandomAccessIterator first, RandomAccessIterator last, Comp comp) {
   // Only use bitset partitioning for arithmetic types.  We should also check
   // that the default comparator is in use so that we are sure that there are no
   // branches in the comparator.
+#if _LIBCPP_STD_VER >= 20
   std::__introsort<_ClassicAlgPolicy,
                    ranges::less,
                    RandomAccessIterator,
                    __use_branchless_sort<ranges::less, RandomAccessIterator>>(first, last, ranges::less{}, depth_limit);
+#else
+  std::__introsort<_ClassicAlgPolicy,
+                   __less<>,
+                   RandomAccessIterator,
+                   __use_branchless_sort<__less<>, RandomAccessIterator>>(first, last, __less<>{}, depth_limit);
+#endif
 }
 
 // clang-format off
diff --git a/src/include/from_chars_floating_point.h b/src/include/from_chars_floating_point.h
index 9cbabcd106..313c7ea66d 100644
--- a/src/include/from_chars_floating_point.h
+++ b/src/include/from_chars_floating_point.h
